category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gettext-devel libglib2.0-devel
sdesc: "Charset conversion library for TI calculators (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "The ticonv library is a library which handles the various TI charsets and
conversion to/from UTF-8/16 through a set of functions which constitutes a
common API."
